I am now in the corridor.
My suitcase is standing on the floor.
It is very heavy.
I pull the suitcase.
That is quite loud.
Then a door opens.
Frau Krüger stands in the doorway.
Her small dog Bruno is standing next to the door.
She smiles kindly.
"Do you need help, Ms. Flores?" asks Frau Krüger.
"Yes, please," I say.
Frau Krüger helps me immediately.
She takes the other side.
We carry the suitcase together.
Now we are standing in front of my new door.
A small sign is hanging on the door.
The suitcase is standing safely on the floor.
A mat is lying under the suitcase.
"Thank you very much, Frau Krüger," I say.
"You're welcome," she says.
